now if she has the necessary talent and she is not Korean. But thanks to the documentary, her group, an unexpected love interest, and a run-in with a famous actor, she'll find the confidence to pursue her dream.","language":"en-US"},"startDate":"2023-09-27","endDate":"2025-07-14","status":"Ended","rating":8.4,"ratingCount":9,"numberOfEpisodes":12,"numberOfSeasons":2,"genres":["Commedia","Dramma","Famiglia"],"countries":["Mexico"],"facts":{"Runtime":"30m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":835,"name":"Disney Channel","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rxhJszKVAvAZYTmF0vfRHfyo4Fb.png"},{"id":2739,"name":"Disney+","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1edZOYAfoyZyZ3rklNSiUpXX30Q.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2367727,"name":"Andrea de Alba","role":"Andrea","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/whZy3kK4ngU3qGABV492iCdYbQn.jpg"},{"id":4261841,"name":"Isan Beomhyun Lee","role":"Ji-Won","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Q2SDcZzoMdVexU9KLlawmqE5wo.jpg"},{"id":1319077,"name":"Alicia Jaziz Zapién","role":"Pau","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bP31nuiVtmcwCpFi9C6vecIIH2I.jpg"},{"id":3627557,"name":"Ji Moon","role":"Hyejin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r6Z9udnETL6lRlJgDcknxxdmi0s.jpg"},{"id":1487906,"name":"Arantza Ruiz","role":"Indra","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iVrwTFygTRzwj3AodMF1aEU5ZDy.jpg"},{"id":3627560,"name":"Diego Casba","role":"Pablo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4TWxemvJvAlEsrAqoItJwGcpJ8u.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","overview":"Film student Pau is making a documentary about her sister Andrea, a K-pop fan. Their parents want Andrea to be a dentist like them and to have a stable job and a normal life. She wants to dedicate all of her time to her new cover dance group. But Andrea has another dream that she keeps secret: she wants to be a singer and dedicate her life to music. She wants to prepare herself in Korea, just like her idols. There are many points against it: she is no longer the ideal age, she does not know if she has the necessary talent and she is not Korean. But thanks to the documentary, her group, an unexpected love interest, and a run-in with a famous actor, she'll find the confidence to pursue her dream."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Andrea, una fan del K-pop, forma su propio grupo de dance covers después de que la corren del anterior. Entonces deberá decidir entre ser odontóloga o seguir su verdadero sueño: prepararse para ser una cantante profesional y hacerlo en el mismo lugar que lo hicieron todos sus ídolos - en Corea. Todo bajo el ojo de su hermana Pau, quien está dirigiendo un documental sobre sus aventuras."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iFTbJLOCVUs5Z67FLz5aamqDH8G.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1kQH1Pybs4OaRuBXkboD2cfTiWE.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2023,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iFTbJLOCVUs5Z67FLz5aamqDH8G.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/206017/season/1"},{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2025,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g2K9ienbcibTyJ74TlPLFmqjauX.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/206017/season/2"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":206017,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"es":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iFTbJLOCVUs5Z67FLz5aamqDH8G.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iFTbJLOCVUs5Z67FLz5aamqDH8G.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"heigh